sequenceDiagram
    actor P as Pelanggan
    participant BP as Browser Pelanggan
    participant S as Server (Express)
    participant SK as Socket.io
    participant BK as Browser Kasir
    actor K as Kasir
    participant DB as MySQL Database

    Note over P,DB: Kasir menerima pesanan baru real-time

    K->>BK: Login & buka /kasir
    BK->>SK: Connect to Socket.io
    SK-->>BK: Connected

    P->>BP: Buat pesanan (UC-05)
    BP->>S: POST /api/orders {...}
    S->>DB: INSERT order + items
    S->>SK: emit("new_order", orderData)
    SK->>BK: Event "new_order"
    BK-->>K: Notifikasi: Pesanan baru masuk!
    BK->>BK: Tambahkan ke daftar pesanan

    S-->>BP: Response {order}

    Note over P,DB: Kasir memproses pesanan

    K->>BK: Pilih pesanan & tekan "Proses"
    BK->>S: PATCH /api/orders/{id}/status {status: "processing"}

    S->>S: Middleware auth: verify JWT
    S->>DB: SELECT * FROM orders WHERE id = ?
    S->>DB: UPDATE orders SET status = "processing"
    S->>DB: SELECT order WITH relations
    DB-->>S: Updated order

    S->>SK: emit("order_updated", updatedOrder)
    SK->>BK: Event "order_updated"
    SK->>BP: Event "order_updated"

    BK-->>K: Update status di dashboard
    BP-->>P: Update status di halaman tracking

    S-->>BK: Response {order: updatedOrder}

    Note over P,DB: Kasir menyelesaikan pesanan

    K->>BK: Tekan "Selesai"
    BK->>S: PATCH /api/orders/{id}/status {status: "completed"}

    S->>DB: UPDATE orders SET status = "completed"
    S->>SK: emit("order_updated", updatedOrder)
    SK->>BP: Event "order_updated"
    BP-->>P: Status: Pesanan Selesai ✅

    S-->>BK: Response success